ARM PrimeCell reference cell library deliverable
================================================

Vendor:  Avant! 
Library: Passport CB18
Release: 2000.3 (v1.0)

Created: 12 June 2002

Installation disk space required
--------------------------------

The file requires 39 MBytes of free disk space
when uncompressed and un-tar'ed.

Copy the file to a suitable location.

To uncompress and tar extract the file
--------------------------------------

Enter the following UNIX commands:

uncompress CB18_2000.3.tar.z 

tar -xvf CB18_2000.3.tar

Contents
--------

The file CB18_2000.3.lst is an text (ASCII) list file 
of the tar file CB18_2000.3.tar.

This ARM PrimeCell reference library deliverable only contains:
  - Synopsys technology library files (*.db)
  - VITAL simulation views (for VHDL simulator)
  - Verilog simulation views
  - Documents
     
The complete Passport CB18 is available from Avant!

The VITAL and Verilog views both contain UNIX make
files which have been used for HDL compilation using
Model Technology Inc, ModelSim simulator in the modeltech
directory.

Directory structure
-------------------

The libraries normally use the following directory structure
and environment variables for PrimeCell make files default
to this structure.

  |
  |---AMBA_Peripherals
  |     |
  |     |---ssmc_pl093
  |     |
  |     |---clcd_pl110
  |     |
  |
  |---LIBRARIES
  |     |
  |     |---avanti
  |     |     |
  |     |     |---2000.3
  |     |     |     |
  |     |     |     |---cb18

--------------------------------------- End ------------------------------------
